<meta charset='utf-8'><section data-mw-section-id="0" id="mwAQ" style="color: rgb(47, 51, 53); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(220, 218, 215); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><p id="mwCQ" style="margin: 0.5em 0px 1em;"><b id="mwCg">대한민국의 행정 구역</b>(大韓民國- 行政區域)은 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD" title="대한민국" id="mwCw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">대한민국</a>의 통치권을 행사하는 지역에서 1개의 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%8A%B9%EB%B3%84%EC%8B%9C" title="특별시" id="mwDA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">특별시</a>, 1개의 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%86%B5%ED%95%A9%ED%8A%B9%EB%B3%84%EC%8B%9C" title="통합특별시" class="mw-redirect" id="mwDQ" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">통합특별시</a>, 5개의 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EA%B4%91%EC%97%AD%EC%8B%9C" title="광역시" id="mwDg" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">광역시</a>, 5개의 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%EB%8F%84" title="대한민국의 도" id="mwDw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">도</a>, 3개의 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%8A%B9%EB%B3%84%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EB%8F%84" title="특별자치도" id="mwEA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">특별자치도</a>, 1개의 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%8A%B9%EB%B3%84%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EC%8B%9C" title="특별자치시" id="mwEQ" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">특별자치시</a>로 구성된다. 이상 총 16개의 행정구역은 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EA%B4%91%EC%97%AD%EC%A7%80%EB%B0%A9%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EB%8B%A8%EC%B2%B4" title="광역지방자치단체" id="mwEg" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">광역지방자치단체</a>로 분류된다.</p><p id="mwEw" style="margin: 0.5em 0px 1em;">단, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%B9%84%EC%88%98%EB%8F%84%EA%B6%8C" title="비수도권" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">비수도권</a> 지역 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%86%B5%ED%95%A9%ED%8A%B9%EB%B3%84%EC%8B%9C" title="통합특별시" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFQ" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">통합특별시</a>는 1개, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EA%B4%91%EC%97%AD%EC%8B%9C" title="광역시" id="mwFg" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">광역시</a>는 4개, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%EB%8F%84" title="대한민국의 도" id="mwFw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">도</a>는 4개, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%8A%B9%EB%B3%84%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EB%8F%84" title="특별자치도" id="mwGA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">특별자치도</a>는 3개, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%8A%B9%EB%B3%84%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EC%8B%9C" title="특별자치시" id="mwGQ" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">특별자치시</a>는 1개이므로 총 13개이다.</p><p id="mwGg" style="margin: 0.5em 0px 1em;"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%84%9C%EC%9A%B8%ED%8A%B9%EB%B3%84%EC%8B%9C" title="서울특별시" id="mwGw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">서울특별시</a>는 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%EA%B5%AC#%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EA%B5%AC" title="대한민국의 구" id="mwHA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">자치구</a>로, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EA%B4%91%EC%97%AD%EC%8B%9C" title="광역시" id="mwHQ" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">광역시</a>는 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%EA%B5%AC#%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EA%B5%AC" title="대한민국의 구" id="mwHg" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">자치구</a>와 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%EA%B5%B0" title="대한민국의 군" id="mwHw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">군</a><sup about="#mwt9" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-1&quot;}}" style="line-height: 1; unicode-bidi: isolate; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 13.6px;"><a href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%ED%96%89%EC%A0%95_%EA%B5%AC%EC%97%AD#cite_note-1" id="mwIA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwIQ" style="pointer-events: none;"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIg" style="pointer-events: none;">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIw" style="pointer-events: none;">]</span></span></a></sup>으로, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%EB%8F%84" title="대한민국의 도" id="mwJA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">도</a>와 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EA%B0%95%EC%9B%90%ED%8A%B9%EB%B3%84%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EB%8F%84" title="강원특별자치도" id="mwJQ" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">강원특별자치도</a>와 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%A0%84%EB%B6%81%ED%8A%B9%EB%B3%84%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EB%8F%84" title="전북특별자치도" id="mwJg" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">전북특별자치도</a>는 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%8B%9C_(%ED%96%89%EC%A0%95_%EA%B5%AC%EC%97%AD)" title="시 (행정 구역)" id="mwJw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">자치시</a>와 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%EA%B5%B0" title="대한민국의 군" id="mwKA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">군</a>으로, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%A0%84%EB%82%A8%EA%B4%91%EC%A3%BC%ED%86%B5%ED%95%A9%ED%8A%B9%EB%B3%84%EC%8B%9C" title="전남광주통합특별시" id="mwKQ" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">전남광주통합특별시</a>는 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%EA%B5%AC#%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EA%B5%AC" title="대한민국의 구" id="mwKg" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">자치구</a>와 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%8B%9C_(%ED%96%89%EC%A0%95_%EA%B5%AC%EC%97%AD)" title="시 (행정 구역)" id="mwKw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">자치시</a>와 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%EA%B5%B0" title="대한민국의 군" id="mwLA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">군</a>으로 하위 행정구역을 둔다. 이상의 행정구역은 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EA%B8%B0%EC%B4%88%EC%A7%80%EB%B0%A9%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EB%8B%A8%EC%B2%B4" title="기초지방자치단체" id="mwLQ" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">기초지방자치단체</a>로 분류된다. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%A0%9C%EC%A3%BC%ED%8A%B9%EB%B3%84%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EB%8F%84" title="제주특별자치도" id="mwLg" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">제주특별자치도</a>와 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%84%B8%EC%A2%85%ED%8A%B9%EB%B3%84%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EC%8B%9C" title="세종특별자치시" id="mwLw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">세종특별자치시</a>에는 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EA%B8%B0%EC%B4%88%EC%A7%80%EB%B0%A9%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EB%8B%A8%EC%B2%B4" title="기초지방자치단체" id="mwMA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">기초지방자치단체</a>를 두지 않으며, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%A0%9C%EC%A3%BC%ED%8A%B9%EB%B3%84%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EB%8F%84" title="제주특별자치도" id="mwMQ" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">제주특별자치도</a>에는 자치시가 아닌 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%96%89%EC%A0%95%EC%8B%9C" title="행정시" id="mwMg" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">행정시</a>를 둔다. 행정시는 제주특별자치도지사 직속으로 그 역할을 하며 기초지방자치단체로서의 권한이 없다. 2019년 12월 기준으로, 1개 통합특별시, 8개 도, 6개 광역시에는 총 75개의 자치시와 82개의 자치군이 설치되어 있으며, 특별시, 통합특별시, 5개 광역시에는 총 64개의 자치구<sup about="#mwt10" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-2&quot;}}" style="line-height: 1; unicode-bidi: isolate; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 13.6px;"><a href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%ED%96%89%EC%A0%95_%EA%B5%AC%EC%97%AD#cite_note-2" id="mwMw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwNA" style="pointer-events: none;"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwNQ" style="pointer-events: none;">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwNg" style="pointer-events: none;">]</span></span></a></sup>가 설치되어 있다.<sup about="#mwt11" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-3&quot;}}" style="line-height: 1; unicode-bidi: isolate; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 13.6px;"><a href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%ED%96%89%EC%A0%95_%EA%B5%AC%EC%97%AD#cite_note-3" id="mwNw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwOA" style="pointer-events: none;"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwOQ" style="pointer-events: none;">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwOg" style="pointer-events: none;">]</span></span></a></sup></p><p id="mwOw" style="margin: 0.5em 0px 1em;"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%8A%B9%EB%B3%84%EC%8B%9C" title="특별시" id="mwPA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">특별시</a>와 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EA%B4%91%EC%97%AD%EC%8B%9C" title="광역시" id="mwPQ" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">광역시</a>를 제외한 인구 50만명 이상의 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%8B%9C_(%ED%96%89%EC%A0%95_%EA%B5%AC%EC%97%AD)" title="시 (행정 구역)" id="mwPg" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">자치시</a>에는 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%EA%B5%AC#%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EA%B5%AC%EA%B0%80_%EC%95%84%EB%8B%8C_%EA%B5%AC" title="대한민국의 구" id="mwPw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">일반구</a>를 둘 수 있다. 일반구는 기초지방자치단체로서의 권한이 없어, 특별시·통합특별시·광역시에 설치된 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%EA%B5%AC#%EC%9E%90%EC%B9%98%EA%B5%AC" title="대한민국의 구" id="mwQA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">자치구</a>와 구별된다. 일반구의 구청장은 일반직 지방공무원으로 보(補)하고 시장이 임명한다. 구청장은 시장의 지휘·감독을 받아 소관 국가사무 및 지방자치사무를 맡아 처리하고 소속 직원을 지휘·감독한다.</p><p id="mwQQ" style="margin: 0.5em 0px 1em;">시(자치시, 행정시)와 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%EA%B5%AC" title="대한민국의 구" id="mwQg" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">구(자치구, 일반구)</a>는 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%9D%8D" title="읍" id="mwQw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">읍</a>·<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%A9%B4_(%ED%96%89%EC%A0%95_%EA%B5%AC%EC%97%AD)" title="면 (행정 구역)" id="mwRA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">면</a>·<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%96%89%EC%A0%95%EB%8F%99" title="행정동" id="mwRQ" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">행정동</a>으로, 군은 읍·면으로 하위 행정구역을 둔다. 다시 읍·면은 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%A6%AC_(%ED%96%89%EC%A0%95_%EA%B5%AC%EC%97%AD)" title="리 (행정 구역)" id="mwRg" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">리</a>로, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%96%89%EC%A0%95%EB%8F%99" title="행정동" id="mwRw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">행정동</a>은 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%86%B5_(%ED%96%89%EC%A0%95_%EA%B5%AC%EC%97%AD)" title="통 (행정 구역)" id="mwSA" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">통</a>으로 나뉜다. 통 및 행정리는 말단 행정 구역인 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%B0%98_(%ED%96%89%EC%A0%95_%EA%B5%AC%EC%97%AD)" title="반 (행정 구역)" id="mwSQ" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">반</a>으로 나뉜다. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%86%B5_(%ED%96%89%EC%A0%95_%EA%B5%AC%EC%97%AD)" title="통 (행정 구역)" id="mwSg" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">통</a>과 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%B0%98_(%ED%96%89%EC%A0%95_%EA%B5%AC%EC%97%AD)" title="반 (행정 구역)" id="mwSw" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">반</a>은 실생활에서 거의 사용되지 않는다.</p></section><section data-mw-section-id="1" id="mwTQ" aria-labelledby="행정_구역별_인구_및_면적" style="color: rgb(47, 51, 53); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(220, 218, 215); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2" style="color: rgb(38, 41, 43); font-weight: normal; margin: 0.25em 0px; padding-top: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0.17em; display: flow-root; word-break: break-word; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(160, 154, 146); font-size: 1.5em; font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 1.375;"><h2 id="행정_구역별_인구_및_면적" style="color: inherit; font-weight: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 0.25em; padding: 0px; display: inline; word-break: break-word; border: 0px; font-size: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.375; font-family: sans-serif !important; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; scroll-margin-top: 75px;"><span id=".ED.96.89.EC.A0.95_.EA.B5.AC.EC.97.AD.EB.B3.84_.EC.9D.B8.EA.B5.AC_.EB.B0.8F_.EB.A9.B4.EC.A0.81" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span>행정 구역별 인구 및 면적</h2><span class="mw-editsection" style="user-select: none; font-size: small; font-weight: normal; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 0px; margin-inline: 1em 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: 0; unicode-bidi: isolate; font-family: sans-serif;"></span></div><ul id="mwTg" style="margin: 0.3em 0px 0px 1.6em; margin-inline: 1.6em 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: disc;"><li id="mwTw" style="margin-bottom: 0.1em;">괄호()는 기초자치단체가 아닌 명목상의 행정 구역이다.</li></ul><table border="1" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" class="sortable wikitable sort-under static-row-numbers jquery-tablesorter" id="mwUQ" style="border: 1px solid rgb(160, 154, 146); font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(216, 214, 210); color: rgb(47, 51, 53); margin: 1em 0px; border-collapse: collapse; counter-reset: rowNumber 0; text-align: right;"><thead><tr id="mwUw" data-darkreader-inline-bgimage="" data-darkreader-inline-bgcolor="" style="background: rgb(221, 221, 255); margin: 10px; vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center; --darkreader-inline-bgimage: initial; --darkreader-inline-bgcolor: #d0cdc9;"><th id="mwVA" class="headerSort" tabindex="0" role="columnheader button" title="오름차순 정렬" style="border: 1px solid rgb(160, 154, 146); padding: 0.2em 21px 0.2em 0.4em; background-color: rgb(207, 205, 201); color: rgb(47, 51, 53); text-align: center; background-image: url(&quot;/w/resources/src/jquery.tablesorter.styles/images/sort_both.svg?0e440&quot;); cursor: pointer; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: right center;">행정 구역</th><th id="mwVQ" class="headerSort" tabindex="0" role="columnheader button" title="오름차순 정렬" style="border: 1px solid rgb(160, 154, 146); padding: 0.2em 21px 0.2em 0.4em; background-color: rgb(207, 205, 201); color: rgb(47, 51, 53); text-align: center; background-image: url(&quot;/w/resources/src/jquery.tablesorter.styles/images/sort_both.svg?0e440&quot;); cursor: pointer; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: right center;">넓이 (km<sup id="mwVg" style="line-height: 1; font-size: 13.6px;">2</sup>)</th><th id="mwVw" class="headerSort" tabindex="0" role="columnheader button" title="오름차순 정렬" style="border: 1px solid rgb(160, 154, 146); padding: 0.2em 21px 0.2em 0.4em; background-color: rgb(207, 205, 201); color: rgb(47, 51, 53); text-align: center; background-image: url(&quot;/w/resources/src/jquery.tablesorter.styles/images/sort_both.svg?0e440&quot;); cursor: pointer; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: right center;">인구 (명)</th><th id="mwWA" class="headerSort" tabindex="0" role="columnheader button" title="오름차순 정렬" style="border: 1px solid rgb(160, 154, 146); padding: 0.2em 21px 0.2em 0.4em; background-color: rgb(207, 205, 201); color: rgb(47, 51, 53); text-align: center; background-image: url(&quot;/w/resources/src/jquery.tablesorter.styles/images/sort_both.svg?0e440&quot;); cursor: pointer; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: right center;">시·<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%AF%BC%EA%B5%AD%EC%9D%98_%EB%8F%84%EC%B2%AD_%EC%86%8C%EC%9E%AC%EC%A7%80" title="대한민국의 도청 소재지" id="mwWQ" style="color: rgb(49, 97, 194); text-decoration: none; background: none; border-radius: 2px; overflow-wrap: break-word;">도</a>청 소재지</th><th id="mwWg" class="headerSort" ta